TYPESAFE_API_KEY is not set, so every Jev strategy is reported UNAVAILABLE.
To enable it (do not paste the key into chat):
  1. cp .env.example .env            (in the DEEPSIFT repository root)
  2. edit .env and set  TYPESAFE_API_KEY=<your key>
  3. export it for CLI runs:  set -a; . ./.env; set +a
  4. uv run python scripts/jev_smoke.py      (verifies one call before any benchmark)
`npm run demo` and scripts/run_study.py load .env automatically.
→ continuing with every non-Jev strategy; Jev strategies are reported UNAVAILABLE.

